"Модуль добавляет аспект ``recording-aspect`` с атрибутами ``recording`` "
"(аудиофайл), ``transcription``, ``transcriptionDiarized``, ``summary``, "
"``recordingDuration``, ``recordingStatus``, ``callPlatform``, "
"``meetingUrl``. Аспект подключается к типам ``meeting-activity`` и "
"``call-activity`` через artifact-patch."
msgstr ""
"The module adds a ``recording-aspect`` with attributes ``recording`` "
"(audio file), ``transcription``, ``transcriptionDiarized``, ``summary``, "
"``recordingDuration``, ``recordingStatus``, ``callPlatform``, "
"``meetingUrl``. The aspect is attached to the ``meeting-activity`` and "
"``call-activity`` types via artifact-patch."

